cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Dhago: a compliance-first credit assessment pipeline for informal borrowers in Nepal"
abstract: >-
  A multi-agent loan-assessment pipeline that checks an applicant's declared income
  against observed transaction records (mobile wallet, remittance, cooperative sales),
  applies lending rules kept as versioned configuration, estimates a probability of
  default with a monotone gradient-boosted model, and records every step in a
  hash-chained audit log. Built for the GIBL AI/ML Hackathon 2026 and evaluated on the
  organisers' synthetic Track A data.
authors:
